  "summary": "Replaced the earlier clause-restatement split with the free-diagram adjunction, cellular factorizations and model-recognition retract argument. Reused existing Kan, presentability-rank, regular-bound, small-object and anodyne pushout-product nodes. Added the exact Mathlib local-presentability leaf and the general all-cofibrant left-properness theorem. Corrected the earlier child mapping-object error by giving the natural-transformation end formula in the item proof; the imported item statement itself is unchanged.",
